# Copy to `.env` (gitignored). Storybook only: the `AddressField` "WithGooglePlaces" story reads
# this key to call Google's Places API (New) from the browser. Use a key restricted to the
# Places API (New) and to `http://localhost:6006/*` as an HTTP referrer; the library itself
# never reads an env var — consumers pass their own key to `googlePlaces({ apiKey })`.
VITE_GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
